  "description": "The Flightline 24 Plus is your take-anywhere, do-anything gateway to pure fun. Don't let its price fool you, the FL 24 Plus has features found on serious off-road machines. At the heart is a low profile lightweight and rust-free aluminum frame and rigid fork featuring a 1X drive train with Shimano Revo 7-speed twist-shifter and Tourney rear derailleur. Bumps are neutralized thanks to its Plus-size 24 x 2.6\" MTB tires mounted to 31mm wide alloy rims. The FL 24 Plus is designed to keep things light and simple for young Trails-riding enthusiasts.\nHaro FL Plus 6000 Series alloy frame\n1-1/8\" Threadless headset\nFull 6000 Series alloy 1-1/8\" fork\nAlloy crankset w/ 28T narrow-wide chainring, 152mm\nAnti-chain drop guard\nShimano Tourney TY-300 rear derailleur\nShimano Tourney 7-spd Revo shifter & 14-34t freewheel\n31mm wide rims w/ alloy 32h hubs\nH-5183 24\"x2.60\" tires",
